# Bubble Sort Implementation
# Demonstrates sorting algorithm in FlowLang

Define function bubble_sort with parameter items:
    Define n as length of items
    
    # Outer loop for passes
    For i from 0 to (n minus 1):
        # Inner loop for comparisons
        For j from 0 to (n minus i minus 1):
            # Compare adjacent elements
            If items at position j is greater than items at position (j plus 1):
                # Swap elements
                Define temp as items at position j
                Set items at position j to items at position (j plus 1)
                Set items at position (j plus 1) to temp
    
    Return items

# Example usage
Define unsorted_list as list of [64, 34, 25, 12, 22, 11, 90]
Output "Original list:" unsorted_list

Define sorted_list as bubble_sort of unsorted_list
Output "Sorted list:" sorted_list
